{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:45:657","content":{"id":657,"title":"多边形","content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d099e19a-c101-45dd-ab61-3f8e60992e60","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"<polygon>"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以绘制任意形状的多边形，我们只需要通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"points"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指定多边形的顶点坐标（最后不需要指定起点坐标，会自动闭合）"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"0e5362a1-79c5-4adf-8c48-0676e917c17b","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"a5dc0c56-156e-4374-b0d6-1211667f2eac","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<svg width=\"170\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 170 100\">\n  <polygon points=\"50 20, 150 20, 120 70, 20 70\" fill=\"#69a794\" />\n</svg>","collabId":"67531eaa-f86c-4e29-bd43-843f3d575a65","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"html-block","tauContract":"ae642145aa1ba86b2ad23b93d4b1f24ed47731812964ef66e868fa9fd81f6554","html":"<svg width=\"170\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 170 100\">\n  <polygon points=\"50 20, 150 20, 120 70, 20 70\" fill=\"#69a794\" />\n</svg>","collabId":"7644363e-d566-4ef9-8eb5-caa88d47c3fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"31572ce9-f274-4467-ac6f-6d5898c11933","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有时候我们会定义出的形状会形成多个区域，这个时候的难题就是哪些区域应该填充，那么不填充，这个由填充规则 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"fill-rule"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 确定，有两种填充方法："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"03d37909-9f8d-49cc-9698-d5013a3da104","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"1423421f-155c-4dc3-8d45-6636b96a7b7a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4af3babc-76e2-4207-85f5-8f20975666f4","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nonzero"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：从某区域任意引出一条线，该线会与若干条线相交，如果两条线之间的夹角（两条线是有方向的）小于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"90°"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么就加 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，否则就减 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，如果最终的值不为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0"},{"type":"formatted","text":"（初始值为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0"},{"type":"formatted","text":"），那么就填充该区域，否则不填充（该种方法也称为非零环绕原则）"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"69359203-1a53-4baa-8610-768a3bdeaad7","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cb84e8df-56ab-4402-bc75-d65c6e57c8fd","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"evenodd"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：与上面相似，也是引出一条线，该线与若干条线相交，统计相交的次数，如果次数为奇数，那么就填充，否则不填充"}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"SVG","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:648","type":"doc","id":648}},{"label":"基本概念","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:648","type":"doc","id":648}},{"label":"基本形状","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:652","type":"doc","id":652}},{"label":"多边形","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:657","type":"doc","id":657}}],"prevPage":{"title":"圆和椭圆","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:656","type":"doc","id":656}},"nextPage":{"title":"路径","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:668","type":"doc","id":668}},"createTime":1703605489608,"updateTime":1743303640565,"projectId":45},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640565},"pluginRenderers":[{"runtimeVersion":1,"manifest":{"id":"tau.html","name":"HTML","version":"0.1.1